Notes:
In comparison with wf-metagenomics pipeline, I delete "-m 50 --secondary=no"
I use "-ax map-ont" to make it more thorough (not fastened host removal like previously implemented in the pipeline)
I streamline minimap2 to avoid intermediate SAM files
I move /exclude_host_hac/ up one level out of /output_demux_hac/
I copy all of the fastq data to /raw_data/0_compiled_fastq
/raw_data/0_compiled_fastq filled with ALL fastq data after host reduction
I copy them all to /raw_data/0_compiled_fastq_wf_metagenomics_target to generate 1 folder per sample setting


NAVIGATE to/raw_data/0_compiled_fastq_wf_metagenomics_target first! (whether it is "hac" or "sup")
for i in /srv/nfs_share/2026_RESPIRO/raw_data/0_compiled_fastq_wf_metagenomics_target/*.fastq; do
	target_dir="/srv/nfs_share/2026_RESPIRO/raw_data/0_compiled_fastq_wf_metagenomics_target"
	[ -e "$i" ] || continue
	filename=$(basename "$i")
	foldername="${filename%.fastq}"
	
	mkdir -p "$target_dir/$foldername"
	mv "$i" "$target_dir/$foldername/"
done

